    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "B*Ai §/ JAPAN AIR LINES\n7472800 SET ISTAUCTIONS\nTERTAKE-OFF AND LANDING\nSEAT POSITION\nDO NOT REMOVE FROM AIRCRAFT\nSet seat back\nand table in\nupright position.\nNO SMOKING\nRefrain from smoking in\nrestrooms or aisles.\n#Lind To fasten\nFASTEN SEAT\nBELT\nTal.\nKeep seat belt fastened\nwhenever seated.\nTo tighten\nTo unfasten\nA23K7ZDOXYGEN MASK\nOxygen mask will appear automatically when needed.\nPut out your\ncigarette immediately.",
      "##0\nEMERGENCY EXITS\nDO NOT REMOVE FROM AIRCRAFT\nGoa\n009000\n• FOR EVACUATION\nDo not carry any baggage.\n000000000000 00 00\nRemove highheeled shoes.\n/ 00000000000000\nPut out cigarettes before\nevacuating.\n000\n000000\nAfter evacuating, move away\nfrom the aircraft.\nUSE OF EMERGENCY EXITS\n000",
      "SUD\nB*Ai} / JAPAN AIR LINES\nBEDLED SAFETY INSTRUCTIONS\n*AA LIFE VEST\n2\nInflate when instructed by a crew member.\n3\n4\n5\nđt3.\nTo inflate\n8\nPull string to\nlight emer\ngency\nbeacon.\nFor extra\ninflation, blow\ninto mouth\npieces.\n*7** BRACE POSITIONS"
    ],
